  "content": "<h1>Простая горячая шкала</h1><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsimple-hotbar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/modrinth@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Простая горячая шкала на Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/simple-hotbar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/curseforge@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Простая горячая шкала на CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/patreon@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"amongstreality на Patreon\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/bmc@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"amongstreality на Buy Me a Coffee\"></a></p><p>Этот пакет изменит внешний вид вашей горячей шкалы, значков сердца и брони, а также заставит значок соединения менять цвет в зависимости от пинга.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Вы можете поддержать меня и мои проекты здесь</h2><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/labeled/patreon@3x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/labeled/bmc@3x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Buy Me a Coffee\"></a></p>",
